  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "大中華與全球政治經濟",
    "sub_ename": "THE GREATER CHINA AND THE GLOBAL POLITICAL ECONOMY",
    "describe_ch": "促進了解 — 大中華經濟圈與全球的政治經濟，包括私人企業對此一領域的影響。由各相關當事人所推動的投資與貿易，促成商品驅動的區域化與全球化。對於關心兩岸商貿發展的學生而言，在全球化的時代研究大中華已變得更便利與重要。",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to further the understanding of the Greater China and the global political economy, including entrepreneurs' impact in this field. The commodity-driven regionalization and globalization result from investment and trade promoted by the stakeholders.  Studying the Greater China in an era of globalization, especially post-ECFA (Economic Cooperation Framework Agreement), has become relatively easy and important for the students in both China and Taiwan.",
